# Shell scripts must keep LF. This repo is worked on with core.autocrlf=true, and
# a hook checked out with CRLF fails on Linux and macOS with a "bad interpreter"
# error that names no useful cause. Scoped deliberately to these paths: a
# repo-wide renormalisation would rewrite every tracked file in one diff.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
